          "description": "An iron claw can wrap its craws around its target squeezing the life from them. The iron claw must make a melee touch attack (+23), if it hits, 14d6 points of non-elemental damage and must make a Fortitude save (DC 21) or be inflicted with the Paralysis status for 1d4+1 rounds. Blue mages may learn this ability as a 6th level spell (Knowledge: Arcana DC 27).",
