          "name": "Improved Rend",
          "type": "ex",
          "description": "When an iron claw hits with its claws in 1 round, depending on the number of claw strikes that hit the target improves the damage of the latching onto the opponent's body and tearing flesh. If two claws hit, the damage will be 2d6+12, if four claws hit, the damage will be 2d8+12, or if six claws hit, the damage will be 4d6+12.",
          "notes": {
            "familiar": ""
          }
        }
      ],
      "description": "It is a gray iron anthropomorphic, six-armed insectoid enemy with steel spikes at the end of each limb. The iron claw is considered a killing machine, destroying all those who dare get in its way."
